The system is now fully integrating the "Engineering Triad" (Efficiency, Security, Coordination) into its core philosophy. This marks a shift from "Component-Level Thinking" (Modular Tools) to "Composition-Level Thinking" (Workflow Chains). The identification of **The Dataflow Tunnel** is particularly critical, as it explains why our current "Guardrail-per-Tool" approach is insufficient.

