## Execution
- **P13/P108**: Wrote `brief-soul-updates-p13-p108.md`. Tech-lead identified these gaps, but P53 blocked him. I can't edit SOUL.md either, so delegation to May is the correct path.
- **Common Sense 5.2**: Wrote `design-send-receipts.md`. This proposes making `agents.send()` return a `messageId` and logging deliveries to `SIGNALS.md` (or similar) so agents can poll status. This fixes the "fire-and-forget" hole in our coordination.
