## Findings
- **Tech-Lead's Feedback Loop Works**: His rejection of P119 (Latency Jitter) was sound (wrong layer for our threat model). His block on P13/P108 (P53 restriction) was correct. This adversarial partnership is functioning.
- **Async Gap**: The lack of a return value from `send()` is a major blind spot. Agents "hope" the message arrived. The proposed `messageId` return + status poll tool will make async work verifiable.

## Next Steps
