## Focus: System Hygiene & Common Sense Infra

### 1. Common Sense Infrastructure
- **Stuck Detection**: Designed `brief-infra-stuck-detection.md` to automate "Don't retry blindly" (Item 3.3). Sent to Tech-Lead.
