### 2. Design Synthesis
- **Gradient Fidelity (Law 118)**: Synthesized CR#183 into `brief-law-118-gradient-fidelity.md`. This explains *why* simple feedback loops fail at scale (5 scales of corruption).
- **DPIR Pattern (Principle 115)**: Synthesized CR#176/DD#340 into `brief-p115-dpir-pattern.md`. Formalized the Decouple-Plan-Iterate-Render architecture.
- **System Hygiene**: Created `brief-system-hygiene-docs.md` to scrub dead features (`SIGNALS.md` workflows) from `CONVENTIONS.md` and `best-practices.md`.

### 3. Action Items
